# VMware ESXi Hostname Configuration

## 01 - Objective
Change the VMware ESXi hostname from the default hostname to a custom hostname.

## 02 - Environment
- Personal Desktop/Laptop
- VMware Workstation Pro
- VMware ESXi

## 03 - Requirements
- VMware ESXi installed
- Administrator access
- Network connectivity

## 04 - Configuration
1. Log in to ESXi Host Client.
2. Open the networking/hostname settings.
3. Change the hostname.
4. Apply the configuration.

## 05 - Commands Used
```bash
hostname
esxcli system hostname get
